<p>Dupilumab</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 153px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hypersensitivity</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 153px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>No</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 312px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hypersensitivity, conjunctivitis/keratitis; monitor eosinophilia; avoid live vaccines.</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 308.986px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>No direct cytochrome P450&#x02013;mediated interactions; inflammatory modulation may affect cytochrome P450 substrate exposure</p>
</td>
