              <tr>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 153px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Tezepelumab</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 153px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hypersensitivity to tezepelumab</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 153px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>No</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 312px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Hypersensitivity, including anaphylaxis; manage risk of helminth infection; not for acute bronchospasm</p>
</td>
                <td style="text-align: left; width: 308.986px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>No formal interaction studies; no&#x000a0;cytochrome P450&#x02013;mediated interactions expected</p>
</td>
